            }}>
              Medical Triage
            </h3>

            <p style={{ marginBottom: '1.5rem' }}>
              During pandemics or mass casualty events, medical professionals face trolley-problem-like decisions when allocating limited resources. Should ventilators go to younger patients with better survival odds, or should age not factor into the decision?
            </p>

